---
import { site } from '../data/site';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="foot" data-tone="marigold">
  <div class="foot__cta">
    <p class="foot__lead">Free and open source. Version {site.version}, MIT licence.</p>
    <a class="foot__big" href="/install/">Install Channel Almanac <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    <p class="foot__lead">Works in {site.browsers}.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="foot__cols">
    <nav aria-label="Site">
      <h2 class="foot__h">Site</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a class="ul" href="/">Home</a></li>
        {site.nav.map((n) => <li><a class="ul" href={n.href}>{n.label}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <nav aria-label="Project">
      <h2 class="foot__h">Project</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a class="ul" href={site.amo}>Firefox Add-ons</a></li>
        <li><a class="ul" href={site.repo}>Source on GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a class="ul" href={site.zip}>Download ZIP</a></li>
        <li><a class="ul" href={site.issues}>Report a problem</a></li>
        <li><a class="ul" href={site.license}>MIT licence</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div class="foot__colophon">
      <h2 class="foot__h">Colophon</h2>
      <p>Set in Archivo and Fragment Mono. The colour is marigold; the flower’s Latin name, <i>Calendula</i>, comes from the calends, the first day of every month.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="foot__fine">
    <span>© {year} Channel Almanac.</span>
    <span>An independent project, not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by YouTube or Google. YouTube is a trademark of Google LLC.</span>
  </p>
</footer>
